<title>USA: Mercantile completes Mark Twain merger.</title>
<headline>Mercantile completes Mark Twain merger.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Bancorp Inc, a St. Louis-based bank holding company, said Friday it completed its previously announced merger with Mark Twain Bancshares Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction, announced October 28, 1996, received regulatory approval during the first quasrter and shareholder approval at the corporations' respective shareholder meetings held earlier this week.</p>
<p>Mark Twain holders will receive 0.952 shares of Mercantile stock for each share of Mark Twain common stock.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
